Yep, patch writers who read the newsgroup or otherwise communicate with
each other could agree using different slots for different patches.
With the principle that whoever releases one's patch first, chooses first.
If somebody else has been writing another patch at the same time, it
shouldn't be hard to change it to use another slot when the first patch is
released, before releasing the second patch.
And people who don't read the newsgroup and don't download other people's
patches.. they shouldn't have any problem if their patch conflicts with
some other patch they don't use.

